<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-VELEZ SARSFIELD BEAT CRUZEIRO 2-0 IN SUPERCUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VELEZ SARSFIELD BEAT CRUZEIRO 2-0 IN SUPERCUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Velez Sarsfield (Argentina)</p>
<p>beat Cruzeiro (Brazil) 2-0 (halftime 2-0) in the second leg of</p>
<p>the South American Supercup final on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Patricio Camps (4th minute), Gelson, own goal</p>
<p>(8th)</p>
<p>Velez Sarsfield win 3-0 on aggregate.</p>
<p>Note: the Supercup is played every year between past</p>
<p>winners of the Libertadores Cup.</p>
</text>
